  "title": "nstime: remove incorrectly-named defines.",
  "description": "WS_MSECS_PER_NSEC is defined as the number of nanoseconeds per\nmillisecond (one million), not the number of milliseconds per nanosecond\n(one millionth).\n\nWS_USECS_PER_NSEC is defined as the number of nanoseconds per\nmicrosecond (one thousand), nto the number of microseconds per\nnanosecond (one thousandth).\n\nThere are also correctly-named defines; use them instead of the\nincorrectly-named ones, and remove the incorrectlyu-named ones.",
